It’s a perfect description
for our characters.

00:11:45.320 --> 00:11:48.720
Let’s move on to the next activity.

00:12:00.500 --> 00:12:01.720
Did you put poison in it?

00:12:01.840 --> 00:12:03.160
I’m not saying anything.

00:12:03.300 --> 00:12:04.100
What?

00:12:04.280 --> 00:12:05.780
What would you like to drink?

00:12:05.800 --> 00:12:06.620
I want something strong.

00:12:06.640 --> 00:12:07.920
-Something strong?
-Yes.

00:12:08.620 --> 00:12:09.720
Like this? Is this strong enough?

00:12:10.000 --> 00:12:12.420
White roses? I don’t think they are roses.

00:12:12.660 --> 00:12:13.680
What is this?

00:12:13.720 --> 00:12:15.520
-It makes you feel energetic.
-It makes you feel energetic?

00:12:15.560 --> 00:12:18.060
-Yes.
-Right.

00:12:18.620 --> 00:12:20.220
It’s because of the kitten.

00:12:20.240 --> 00:12:21.180
The kitten.

